      "metric_and_conversion": "The Float64 K-whitening residual is about 2.13e-15, while high-precision K-factor whitening at 80 digits is about 4.45e-87; both high-precision K-factor and converted-Float64-C results reproduce the frozen 80-digit masses from 80 digits upward. Direct Float64-to-ArbFloat promotion round-trips exactly.",
