    "independent_metric_cross_check": "recompute C_K=inv(cholesky(K_high_precision).U), solve C_K'*H_theta*C_K, and evaluate the generalized H_theta*v=lambda*K*v residuals; this checks the metric transform independently from C converted from Float64",
